            "body": "The 'mini.sessions' now automatically creates directory if it is not present.\r\n\r\nCould you, please, update and see if the issue still persists?\r\n\r\nIf yes, does it fix the issue if [this line](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/lua/mini/sessions.lua#L117) is updated with the following one:\r\n```lua\r\n  directory = ('%s%ssession%s'):format(vim.fn.stdpath('data'), H.path_sep, H.path_sep),\r\n```",
